WEBVTT

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:04.190
Happy encounters.

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:06.130
Ill-fated encounters.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.540
It's not that there's meaning in meeting someone.

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.870
But if there's a meaning for having met someone...

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:18.540
...then what kind of meaning
would there be for meeting him?

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:21.670
I've been searching for
that answer for a long time.

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:25.880
And I'll find the answer soon.

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:34.950
You've really cleaned up.

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:36.810
Miss Stacey.

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:39.290
The kids will miss you.

00:01:40.690 --> 00:01:41.850
I'm sorry.

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.760
But you've done good work.

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:49.130
Taking care of the kids who lost
their parents in alien skirmishes.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:50.190
They...

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:53.740
They weren't skirmishes.

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:55.750
No, I suppose not.

00:01:58.280 --> 00:01:59.580
Sorry, Miss...

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:02.170
No, I should be apologizing.

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:05.670
I should be wishing you a good trip.

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:07.740
Stacey...

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:09.880
Hold your head up high.

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:12.430
You've completed your doctorate.

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:26.770
Miss Bartholomew!

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:33.110
Everyone...

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.210
I'll see you!

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:01.510
Block 21, afternoon roll.

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:02.490
Line up!

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:08.450
The investigating committee

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:12.750
will release its Odysseus
Incident report on the 12th.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:14.820
After the meeting adjourned,

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:17.380
Committee Chair Ines answered a few questions.

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:22.360
I firmly believe we all must take
an active interest in this matter.

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:26.430
To learn from the mistakes of
the past and not repeat them.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:29.390
The public has taken an interest.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:33.240
A 37-year-old prosecution law will be reinstated on the 14th.

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:37.450
It is expected to lead to
still more government cleanups.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.450
Meanwhile, due to the various arrests

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:42.780
in the International United Defense Congress,

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:44.420
otherwise vacated seats are now being filled...

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:45.410
It's him.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:45.740
otherwise vacated seats are now being filled...

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:51.860
This is an old image from the archives.

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:54.130
1.84 parsecs.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:56.450
It appeared about six years ago.

00:03:56.450 --> 00:04:00.690
Roughly 143.3 astronomical units...

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:03.760
Considerably bigger than our solar system.

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:05.710
And the Doppler shift?

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:07.510
Blue.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:09.340
It's moving toward us.

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:35.960
Walton!

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:55.320
Looks like you've grown.

00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:56.890
That can't be.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:58.720
I'm already 19.

00:04:59.490 --> 00:05:01.320
You're already that old?

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.260
I hope you meet...

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:07.290
...him.

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:11.300
Harriet...

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.430
Don't worry, I'm sure I can.

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:16.830
Right?

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:21.780
It's me.

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:23.410
It's fine. Tell me.

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:27.510
I see.

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:28.950
It's decided?

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:32.850
Sorry, I'm afraid something came up.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:37.430
Take care, Walton.

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:40.190
About what I said earlier...

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:43.910
What will you say if you see him again?

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:46.620
I really...

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.540
Think about it.

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:50.000
Let's go.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:04.830
The President's sudden resignation

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:10.930
resulted in a record low turnout
at the defense conference.

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:15.000
Also, scientists are still debating
the approaching nebula.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:18.770
Some say it's another version
of astronaut Yuri Leonov...

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.910
...once believed to be an alien.

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:26.950
Others say it's an unrelated
astronomical phenomenon.

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:29.580
He's coming back.

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:31.340
But...

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:35.820
Number 303, step out.

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:48.470
Lt. Commander, you're pushing the limit!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:49.530
At this rate...

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:52.770
I want to see what Earth technology can do

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:56.440
now that we've got a full copy
of an alien motor and a SARG.

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:08.550
It hasn't changed at all.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:10.390
Impossible.

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:12.360
The aliens... No.

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:15.130
They stopped coming 6 years ago.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:17.340
Our budget has dropped every year.

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:19.880
But peace is better than anything.

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:21.490
Not at all.

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:24.710
There's something scarier than an alien now...

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:26.140
Who's scary?

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:28.900
Sue!

00:07:40.990 --> 00:07:42.420
Bigger than in the picture...

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:44.590
And she's still growing.

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:47.690
Just like your temperament, Commander.

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:49.030
What was that?

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:53.800
You're a good couple.

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:55.120
Who is?
Who is?

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:02.780
Your daddy and mommy shouldn't fight...

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:04.330
...right, Guenevere?

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:15.880
She likes things that fly in the sky.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:26.890
We heard.

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:29.330
You finally decided, huh?

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:35.310
That nebula appeared 6 years ago.

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:37.810
The same day that Frank left.

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:39.780
I wonder if it's to punish us.

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:41.680
For all our sins.

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:42.630
No.

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:47.300
I think this time we can communicate.

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:49.280
With him, too?

00:08:57.060 --> 00:08:58.150
Definitely.

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:09.790
An unusual case, but this
document appears legitimate.

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:13.050
But just out of curiosity...

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:15.650
Are you satisfied?

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:17.150
What do you mean?

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:19.090
The complaint 6 years ago...

00:09:19.090 --> 00:09:22.120
Or perhaps threat is a better word...

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:24.760
That wasn't a very wise thing to do.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:28.420
In fact, it's the reason you're here.

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:31.770
Do you think you've won?

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.190
Won?

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:37.440
I'm just taking responsibility for my actions.

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:38.860
I see.

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:41.830
In any event, it's ironic.

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:45.370
The thing that got you in here is pardoning you.

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:48.750
Congratulations. You're free.

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:12.180
This is a journey of redemption for all humanity.

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:16.480
When times were good, we
forgot what was important.

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:20.210
We lost touch with our dignity
and unspoiled human spirit.

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:22.110
We cared only for today's happiness...

00:10:22.110 --> 00:10:26.380
...and we fell as a species
into a soulless emptiness.

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:31.220
We covered up the contradictions, selfishness,

00:10:31.220 --> 00:10:34.290
lust for power, and loss of integrity.

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:37.830
That pushed a great astronomer far away.

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:40.960
When he returned with his heart already broken,

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:43.230
we didn't welcome him back.

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:47.940
And now, overtaking Bernard's Star,

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:49.890
an unknown nebula is heading toward us.

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:53.810
If that is the return of Yuri Leonov...

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:59.350
We must communicate with
our long-lost friend this time

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:02.790
and greet him with smiles, and kindness and love.

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:09.660
That is why we are launching the Ulysses again.

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:18.660
There it is!

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:37.520
Welcome to the Ulysses.

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:40.820
Colonel Michael Hartland at your service.

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:42.780
Very impressive.

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:47.290
A mission specialist with
degrees in medicine and bionics.

00:11:47.530 --> 00:11:50.130
That little girl has indeed grown up.

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:53.900
But thank you for coming.

00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:56.510
We've had a lot of dropouts...

00:11:56.510 --> 00:12:00.540
...with the maiden voyage
being six light-years off.

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:02.310
No, thank you.

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:05.470
For the chance to see both of them again.

00:12:08.150 --> 00:12:09.310
About that...

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:13.320
He's missing?

00:12:13.860 --> 00:12:17.590
We haven't received word
since he got out of the brig.

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:19.630
Then that means...

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:21.600
He may or may not show.

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:26.070
It was 6 years ago.

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:30.510
That strange guy with the beard
slapped down all the rent money.

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:31.830
Are you really...

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:33.720
Yes, his representative.

00:12:35.220 --> 00:12:38.390
We were thinking of renovating next year.

00:12:38.390 --> 00:12:42.550
But who knows what'll happen
with the news about that nebula.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:18.680
I...

00:13:20.990 --> 00:13:22.990
You should go, of course.

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:28.720
Go?

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:32.630
Pursuit, curiosity, drive.

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:36.640
You'll definitely go if you
are who you used to be.

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:39.010
Professor, but I...

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:40.810
Desire to know more.

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:45.820
Be devoutly curious if you
wish to go far in this life.

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:47.490
But...

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:52.660
What if I'm about to make the same mistake again?

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:55.960
Acting from love but hurting the one I love.

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:58.030
That's why I hate myself.

00:13:58.030 --> 00:13:59.970
Why I close myself off.

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:03.240
That's why I won't...

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:05.700
Dialogue will bridge the gaps.

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:10.640
You weren't in my seminar or
my advanced training program...

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:14.810
...but you were still one
of my favorite students.

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:17.440
Yes, along with Maki.

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:26.570
I can't hear you.

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:45.510
6 years ago?

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:57.060
Maki, I'm sorry...

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:58.460
So sorry.

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:00.940
I finally got it.

00:15:03.330 --> 00:15:05.490
Thank you, Maki.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:09.730
Good-bye.

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:25.550
I want to know...

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:27.850
...more about you, too.

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:32.790
That was a very good speech.

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:33.990
Don't make fun.

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:35.930
No, I'm serious.

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:36.920
I see.

00:15:38.730 --> 00:15:40.060
Forgive me.

00:15:40.470 --> 00:15:42.400
The chance you'll return is low.

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:45.270
No casino would take...

00:15:45.270 --> 00:15:47.820
...a bad bet like this.

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:49.100
Right?

00:15:50.810 --> 00:15:54.460
You were the only one I
could ever put my faith in.

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:56.450
I'm honored...

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:58.210
...Lana Ines.

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:01.010
Good luck.

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:03.320
Captain...

00:16:03.320 --> 00:16:06.920
I'm sending a going-away
present in the last shuttle.

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:08.660
Take care of it.

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:16.330
6 hours to the initial
acceleration of the Ulysses.

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:18.870
Final checks now commencing.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:23.570
Chemical fuel for first stage rocket engines, OK.

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:26.710
Ignition laser now charging.

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:31.680
First nuclear fusion pellet
set at the release chamber.

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:34.050
Captain.

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:38.830
A supply shuttle is requesting
permission to approach.

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:40.760
But this personal code key...

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:42.320
Let it dock.

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:45.500
Private Bartholomew.

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:49.900
There's one last delivery,
but all our hands are busy.

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:51.730
Can you intercept it, please?

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:53.300
Understood.

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:58.650
Captain, this is a stratospheric aircraft.

00:16:58.650 --> 00:17:01.110
Could it be an order to halt?

00:17:45.090 --> 00:17:49.330
First officer of the Ulysses
reporting for duty.

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:51.660
1st Lt. Ryu Soma.

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:57.770
Private Harriet Bartholomew...

00:17:58.370 --> 00:18:01.200
...welcomes you aboard, Lt. Ryu Soma.

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:07.720
Welcome to the Ulysses.

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:11.180
1 minute to initial acceleration.

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:16.900
Harriet, it's my last present to you.

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:22.120
Navigation system functioning normally.

00:18:22.730 --> 00:18:23.990
All green.

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:46.320
30 seconds and counting.

00:18:58.300 --> 00:19:01.460
10 seconds to initial acceleration.

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:04.570
Say hello to him for me.

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:06.410
Nine...

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:08.110
Eight...

00:19:08.110 --> 00:19:09.710
Seven...

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:11.240
Six...

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:12.950
Five...

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:14.610
Four...

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:16.150
Three...

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:17.820
Two...

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:19.450
One...

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:20.260
Zero.

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:22.220
Start initial acceleration!

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:24.390
Ulysses blasting off!

00:20:33.590 --> 00:20:34.760
Reunions.

00:20:34.760 --> 00:20:36.430
Re-separations.

00:20:36.430 --> 00:20:38.550
It's all found in the sea of stars.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:42.700
The story continues forever.

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:48.850
Because rebirth and re-light
is the only future for darkness.
